### Patient Scheduler API Test Script
### Run these requests in order to test the complete workflow

### 1. Create a new patient
POST https://localhost:7000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@email.com",
  "phoneNumber": "555-1234",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "address": "123 Main St, Anytown, USA",
  "medicalHistory": "No known allergies"
}

### 2. Get all patients
GET https://localhost:7000/api/patients

### 3. Get all doctors (pre-seeded data)
GET https://localhost:7000/api/doctors

### 4. Schedule an appointment with automatic billing
POST https://localhost:7000/api/appointments/schedule-with-billing?amount=150.00&dueDate=2024-02-15T00:00:00Z
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 1,
  "appointmentDateTime": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "duration": "01:00:00",
  "notes": "Regular checkup"
}

### 5. Get all appointments
GET https://localhost:7000/api/appointments

### 6. Get all invoices
GET https://localhost:7000/api/invoices

### 7. Process payment for invoice
POST https://localhost:7000/api/invoices/1/process-payment

### 8. Test billing failure scenario (high amount)
POST https://localhost:7000/api/appointments/schedule-with-billing?amount=1500.00&dueDate=2024-02-15T00:00:00Z
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 2,
  "appointmentDateTime": "2024-01-16T14:00:00Z",
  "duration": "01:00:00",
  "notes": "High-value consultation"
}

### 9. Cancel appointment with refund
POST https://localhost:7000/api/appointments/1/cancel-with-refund

### 10. Create a simple appointment without billing
POST https://localhost:7000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 3,
  "appointmentDateTime": "2024-01-20T09:00:00Z",
  "duration": "00:30:00",
  "notes": "Follow-up visit"
}

### 11. Create an invoice manually
POST https://localhost:7000/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "appointmentId": 2,
  "amount": 75.00,
  "dueDate": "2024-02-20T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Follow-up consultation fee"
}

### 12. Update appointment status
PUT https://localhost:7000/api/appointments/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 13. Update invoice
PUT https://localhost:7000/api/invoices/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Paid",
  "paidDate": "2024-01-20T10:00:00Z"
}
